'''Trade and commerce tower''' was a tower located in [[Capital City]] on the [[planet]] [[Lothal]]. It was the tallest building in Capital City during the [[Early rebellion against the Galactic Empire|early rebellion]] against the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="DoR" />

